  "title": "An issue allowing post content to shadow Script Module data with a matching element ID",
  "summary": "Post content can include an element whose ID matches a Script Module's data script, so a post author can replace the data that the module reads.\r\n\r\nWordPress 7.1.4 has been released containing a fix for the vulnerability, and as a courtesy to users on older branches the fix has been backported to all branches back to 6.6.\r\n\r\nDiscovered and responsibly disclosed by Weston Ruter.",
